# BitGet API Credentials
# Get your credentials from: https://www.bitget.com/api/user/apimanager

# Your API Key (required)
BITGET_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Your Secret Key (required)
BITGET_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here

# Your Passphrase (required)
BITGET_PASSPHRASE=your_passphrase_here

# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES:
# 1. NEVER commit this file to git
# 2. Add .env to .gitignore
# 3. Use API keys with restricted permissions (Spot Trading only)
# 4. Enable IP whitelist if available
# 5. Never share these credentials

# PERMISSIONS NEEDED:
# - Spot Trading: Read + Write
# - DO NOT enable: Withdrawal, Futures, Margin

# HOW TO GET CREDENTIALS:
# 1. Go to https://www.bitget.com
# 2. Login → Account → API Management
# 3. Create API Key
# 4. Set permissions: Spot Trading (Read + Write only)
# 5. Copy API Key, Secret Key, and Passphrase
# 6. Paste them below (replace the placeholder values)
